Below is a list of '''Fruits''' from the game, where to obtain them and how much they sell for when processed into [[Jellies and Pickles|Jelly]] using the [[Preserves Jar]], into [[Wine]] using the [[Keg]], or into [[Dried Fruit]] or [[Raisins]] using the [[Dehydrator]]. Note that '''five''' matching Fruits are required to make one Dried Fruit (five Grapes to make Raisins).

Whether or not fruit benefits from the +10% [[Skills#Farming|Tiller]] profession price bonus depends upon whether or not the specific fruit was obtained by foraging, although [[#Tiller Profession Details|the details]] can become complex.

